C(347,'dynamic','波磨波長接觸激振與材料去除量~Corrugation wavelength contact excitation and material removal',
 '鋼軌波磨把空間不平順轉成輪軌週期激振，研磨要同時保留輪廓、材料餘量與缺陷判讀，表面變亮不是品質證明~Rail corrugation converts spatial irregularity into periodic wheel contact excitation; grinding must preserve profile, material reserve and defect interpretation, and a shiny surface is not proof of quality',
 '輪廓儀、合成振動頻譜與材料厚度量測~profilometers, synthetic vibration spectra and material-thickness measurements',
 '小振幅幾何與線性振動近似~small-amplitude geometry and linear vibration approximation',
 '''波磨通過頻率~Corrugation passage frequency | v[m/s]=30; lam[m]=0.06 | v/lam | Hz | 空間波長經速度轉換為時間激振頻率~Speed converts spatial wavelength into temporal forcing frequency | 同步速度及波長頻譜~synchronous speed and wavelength spectrum | 車速改變會移動振動頻峰而非改變波長~Speed change moves the frequency peak without changing wavelength
空間取樣間隔~Spatial sampling interval | v[m/s]=20; fs[Hz]=2000 | v/fs*1000 | mm | 固定取樣頻率下車速越高，沿軌點距越大~At fixed sampling rate, faster travel increases spatial point spacing | 編碼器位置與取樣時刻~encoder position and acquisition time | 空間取樣過疏會混疊短波磨~Coarse spatial sampling aliases short corrugation
正弦輪廓斜率~Sinusoidal profile slope | A[m]=0.00005; lam[m]=0.06 | 2*pi*A/lam | 1 | 同振幅下波長越短，輪廓最大斜率越大~At equal amplitude a shorter wavelength gives a larger maximum slope | 輪廓高度與導數~profile height and its derivative | 只報振幅會忽略短波的陡峭性~Amplitude alone hides the steepness of short waves
幾何激振加速度~Geometric excitation acceleration | A[m]=0.00005; f[Hz]=500 | (2*pi*f)**2*A | m/s2 | 理想追隨正弦輪廓的加速度與頻率平方相關~Ideal sinusoidal profile-following acceleration scales with frequency squared | 幾何輪廓與接觸濾波模型~geometric profile and contact-filter model | 剛性追隨假設可能高估實際輪軌加速度~Rigid following can overestimate actual wheel acceleration
研磨去除體積~Grinding removal volume | width[m]=0.06; depth[m]=0.0001; length[m]=100 | width*depth*length*1e6 | cm3 | 平均去除厚度須乘有效研磨寬度與長度~Mean removal depth multiplies effective width and length | 前後輪廓與有效寬度~before-after profiles and effective width | 假設均勻去除會漏掉局部過磨~Uniform-removal assumptions miss local overgrinding
磨耗剩餘高度~Remaining wear allowance | allowance[mm]=8; used[mm]=5.5; removal[mm]=0.2 | allowance-used-removal | mm | 修整材料與服役磨耗共同消耗同一截面餘量~Corrective removal and service wear consume the same section reserve | 截面掃描與歷史磨耗~section scans and historical wear
頻帶振幅衰減~Band-amplitude reduction | before[um]=40; after[um]=10 | 20*log(after/before)/log(10) | dB | 幅值比用二十倍對數，不能改成能量比公式~Amplitude ratios use twenty times the logarithm, unlike energy ratios | 同頻帶同窗函數頻譜~spectra with matched bands and windows | 改變分析頻帶會製造虛假的改善~Changing the analysis band creates an artificial improvement
摩擦熱輸入~Grinding frictional heat scale | F[N]=100; v[m/s]=20; t[s]=0.2 | F*v*t | J | 接觸作功可能分配到鋼軌、砂輪與碎屑~Contact work partitions among rail, grinding wheel and debris | 接觸功率與表面溫升~contact power and surface temperature rise | 把全部熱量放進鋼軌會高估溫升~Assigning all heat to the rail overestimates heating
波磨再生速率~Corrugation regrowth rate | da[um]=12; M[MGT]=6 | da/M | um/MGT | 按通過總重表示的成長率便於比較不同觀察期~Growth per gross tonnage supports comparison across observation periods | 波磨振幅與通過噸位~corrugation amplitude and gross tonnage | 季節與車種改變會使線性成長外推失效~Season and rolling-stock changes invalidate linear extrapolation
輪廓均方根值~Profile RMS | a1[um]=20; a2[um]=-10; a3[um]=10 | sqrt((a1**2+a2**2+a3**2)/3) | um | 均方根描述高度能量尺度但不保留相位與位置~RMS describes a height-energy scale but discards phase and position | 原始輪廓與位置索引~raw profiles and position index | 相同均方根可對應不同局部缺陷~Equal RMS can correspond to different local defects'''.replace('前後輪廓與有效寬度~before-after profiles and effective width | 假設均勻','前後輪廓與有效寬度~before-after profiles and effective width | 假設均勻').replace('截面掃描與歷史磨耗~section scans and historical wear\n','截面掃描與歷史磨耗~section scans and historical wear | 局部過磨會縮減後續修整餘量~Local overgrinding reduces later correction reserve\n'))

C(348,'signal','動態幾何量測取樣基準與事件定位~Dynamic geometry sampling datums and event location',
 '動態軌道幾何檢測把車載慣性與相對位移轉為沿線幾何，速度、濾波及定位誤差會影響結果，單次超標需能回到明確里程與原始訊號~Dynamic geometry inspection converts onboard inertia and relative displacement into track geometry; speed, filtering and localization affect results, and an exceedance must be traceable to chainage and raw signals',
 '合成慣性感測器、里程編碼器與基準尺~synthetic inertial sensors, distance encoders and reference gauges',
 '離線合成資料與已知取樣條件~offline synthetic data with known sampling conditions',
 '''取樣空間解析度~Sampling spatial resolution | v[m/s]=50; fs[Hz]=1000 | v/fs | m | 同一時間取樣率在不同速度對應不同沿程解析度~A fixed temporal sampling rate gives different spatial resolution at different speeds | 車速與逐筆時間戳~speed and per-sample timestamps | 忽略加減速會造成不均勻空間取樣~Ignoring acceleration produces uneven spatial sampling
最低無混疊波長~Minimum unaliased wavelength | dx[m]=0.05 | 2*dx | m | 奈奎斯特界限是必要條件，實際保真通常需更多點~The Nyquist limit is necessary, while practical fidelity usually needs more samples | 原始與抗混疊濾波訊號~raw and anti-aliased signals | 未濾高頻會讓短波折返成長波~Unfiltered high frequencies fold short waves into longer waves
時間延遲定位差~Latency position error | v[m/s]=50; tau[s]=0.02 | v*tau | m | 感測與定位不同步會把缺陷移到錯誤里程~Unsynchronized sensing and localization move a defect to the wrong chainage | 感測器共同時鐘~a shared sensor clock | 固定延遲在高速形成更大定位誤差~Fixed latency creates larger position error at higher speed
慣性偏差位移漂移~Inertial-bias displacement drift | bias[m/s2]=0.001; t[s]=10 | 0.5*bias*t**2 | m | 固定加速度偏差經雙積分形成二次位移漂移~Constant acceleration bias produces quadratic displacement drift after double integration | 靜止零偏與外部位置基準~stationary bias and external position reference | 長時間積分會把微小偏差放大~Long integration amplifies a small bias
軌距誤差計算~Gauge deviation calculation | measured[mm]=1437; reference[mm]=1435 | measured-reference | mm | 軌距偏差需明確量測高度與內側接觸定義~Gauge deviation needs a defined measurement height and inner-face contact convention | 軌距尺與量測斷面~gauge bar and measurement section | 不同量測高度在磨耗鋼軌上得到不同讀值~Different measurement heights give different readings on worn rail
弦測轉移增益~Chord transfer gain | L[m]=20; lam[m]=40 | 1-cos(pi*L/lam) | 1 | 對稱中點弦測對波長的響應並非固定~Symmetric midpoint chord response varies with wavelength | 已知正弦輪廓的弦測回應~chord response to a known sinusoidal profile | 未修正轉移函數會扭曲不同波段比較~Ignoring the transfer function distorts comparison across bands
局部扭轉估算~Local track twist | dc[mm]=6; base[m]=3 | dc/base | mm/m | 超高差必須附帶量測基長才能定義扭轉~Cant difference requires a measurement base to define twist | 同一基長兩端超高~cant at both ends of one defined base | 不同基長的扭轉值不可直接替代~Twist values over different bases are not interchangeable
離群點比例~Outlier fraction | bad[count]=8; n[count]=2000 | bad/n*100 | percent | 離群比例描述資料品質但不指出異常是設備或真實缺陷~Outlier fraction describes data quality but does not identify sensor faults versus actual defects | 原始波形與重複通過比對~raw traces and repeat-pass comparison | 自動刪除尖峰可能刪掉真正局部缺陷~Automatic spike removal can erase a real local defect
重複通過差值~Repeat-pass difference | x1[mm]=2.2; x2[mm]=1.5 | x1-x2 | mm | 同里程比較前需先校正位置偏移~Repeat-pass comparison needs position registration first | 交叉相關與固定地標~cross-correlation and fixed landmarks | 位置錯位會讓同一缺陷看似變化~Misregistration makes an unchanged defect appear different
檢測率統計~Detection recall | TP[count]=18; FN[count]=2 | TP/(TP+FN)*100 | percent | 檢出率須使用含漏檢的已知真值集~Recall requires a known truth set including missed defects | 盲測標註與事件配對~blinded truth labels and event matching | 只統計已報警事件會隱藏漏檢~Counting only reported events hides misses''')

C(349,'signal','聲程折射耦合盲區與缺陷證據~Sound paths refraction coupling blind zones and defect evidence',
 '超音波探傷以聲束與缺陷交互作用取得間接證據，耦合、角度和鋼軌幾何會改變回波；沒有回波不能獨立證明沒有裂紋~Ultrasonic testing obtains indirect evidence from beam-defect interaction; coupling, angle and rail geometry alter echoes, so absence of an echo alone does not prove absence of a crack',
 '低能教學超音波試塊與合成波形~low-energy ultrasonic teaching blocks and synthetic waveforms',
 '已知均勻聲速及簡化聲程~known uniform wave speed and simplified sound paths',
 '''垂直回波深度~Normal echo depth | c[m/s]=5900; t[s]=0.00002 | c*t/2*1000 | mm | 脈衝回波飛行時間包含往返兩程~Pulse-echo flight time includes outgoing and returning paths | 已知厚度試塊的回波時間~echo time from a block of known thickness | 忘記除二會把缺陷深度加倍~Omitting the factor of two doubles inferred depth
斜入射聲程~Oblique sound path | depth[mm]=50; theta[rad]=0.7853981633974483 | depth/cos(theta) | mm | 斜聲束聲程大於垂向深度~An oblique beam travels farther than the vertical depth | 折射角與反射體位置~refracted angle and reflector location | 把聲程直接當深度會錯定位~Treating sound path as depth mislocates the reflector
水平定位偏距~Horizontal reflector offset | depth[mm]=50; theta[rad]=0.7853981633974483 | depth*sin(theta)/cos(theta) | mm | 反射體水平位置由聲程方向與深度共同決定~Horizontal reflector position depends on beam direction and depth | 探頭座標及折射角~probe coordinate and refracted angle | 探頭方向標記錯誤會把缺陷投到另一側~An incorrect probe orientation projects a defect to the wrong side
頻率波長換算~Frequency-wavelength conversion | c[m/s]=3230; f[Hz]=2500000 | c/f*1000 | mm | 波長影響散射與解析度但不是最小必檢裂紋尺寸~Wavelength affects scattering and resolution but is not the minimum guaranteed detectable crack size | 頻譜中心與材料聲速~spectral centre and material wave speed | 把波長當檢出保證會高估能力~Treating wavelength as a detection guarantee overstates capability
聲幅分貝比較~Echo-amplitude decibel comparison | A[1]=0.2; ref[1]=1 | 20*log(A/ref)/log(10) | dB | 相同量測鏈下幅值比才可作有意義比較~Amplitude ratios are comparable only within a matched measurement chain | 參考反射體與接收增益~reference reflector and receiver gain | 改變增益卻未記錄會形成假缺陷變化~Unrecorded gain changes mimic defect growth
衰減補償量級~Attenuation compensation scale | alpha[dB/mm]=0.02; path[mm]=150 | alpha*path | dB | 均勻衰減近似中總衰減隨聲程增加~Under uniform attenuation the loss grows with path length | 不同距離參考反射體~reference reflectors at different distances | 忽略材質差異會過度補償雜訊~Ignoring material differences can amplify noise excessively
掃描點距估算~Ultrasonic scan spacing | v[m/s]=5; prf[Hz]=2000 | v/prf*1000 | mm | 脈衝重複頻率決定沿掃描方向的名義點距~Pulse repetition frequency determines nominal along-scan spacing | 速度編碼器與脈衝時序~speed encoder and pulse timing | 打滑會造成漏掃區段~Slip can leave an uninspected section
死區相對比例~Dead-zone fraction | dead[mm]=5; total[mm]=150 | dead/total*100 | percent | 近表面死區是幾何範圍而非缺陷機率~Near-surface dead zone is a geometric extent, not defect probability | 近表面人工反射體~near-surface artificial reflectors | 未列盲區會把未檢範圍當作已合格~Unreported blind zones make uninspected regions appear accepted
耦合訊號監測~Coupling signal ratio | back[1]=0.6; baseline[1]=1 | back/baseline | 1 | 背壁回波可協助監測耦合但也受幾何與材質影響~Backwall echoes help monitor coupling but also depend on geometry and material | 背壁回波與表面狀況~backwall echo and surface condition | 耦合流失會使缺陷與背壁回波同時減弱~Coupling loss weakens defect and backwall echoes together
盲測漏檢比例~Blind-test miss fraction | misses[count]=3; total[count]=30 | misses/total*100 | percent | 有已知真值的盲測才能估計樣本漏檢比例~A blinded set with known truth is required to estimate sample miss fraction | 盲測反射體清單與報告~blinded reflector inventory and test report | 只保留成功案例會使績效失真~Keeping only successful cases distorts performance''')

C(350,'structure','軌枕彎曲預力疲勞與環境耐久~Sleeper bending prestress fatigue and environmental durability',
 '軌枕把扣件荷載分散至道碴或支承面，軌座與中部彎矩取決於接觸分布；承載試驗和耐久試驗需要分別定義邊界與損傷指標~Sleepers distribute fastening loads to ballast or support surfaces; rail-seat and centre moments depend on contact distribution, so load tests and durability tests need separate boundaries and damage indicators',
 '縮尺梁、荷重元與裂縫量測~scaled beams, load cells and crack measurements',
 '簡支線彈性梁或明列材料試驗近似~a simply supported linear-elastic beam or stated material-test approximation',
 '''簡支跨中彎矩~Simply supported midspan moment | P[kN]=60; L[m]=1.6 | P*L/4 | kN*m | 跨中集中載重的彎矩取決於支點間距~Moment under a central load depends on support spacing | 荷載與支承距離~load and support spacing | 試驗支點不同會使結果不可直接比較~Different test support positions prevent direct comparison
軌枕彎曲應力~Sleeper bending stress | M[kN*m]=24; Z[m3]=0.002 | M*1000/Z/1e6 | MPa | 彎矩除斷面模數給出線彈性極纖維應力~Moment divided by section modulus gives elastic extreme-fibre stress | 斷面幾何與應變~section geometry and strain | 開裂後仍用未裂斷面會誤估應力~Using an uncracked section after cracking misestimates stress
預力平均壓應力~Mean prestress compression | P[kN]=300; A[m2]=0.05 | P/A/1000 | MPa | 平均預壓可抵消部分拉應力，但偏心也帶入彎矩~Mean precompression offsets some tension, while eccentricity adds a moment | 預力值與端部應變~prestress and end-region strain | 忽略預力損失會高估抗裂能力~Ignoring prestress loss overestimates crack resistance
預力偏心彎矩~Prestress eccentric moment | P[kN]=300; e[m]=0.02 | P*e | kN*m | 預力筋偏離截面形心造成橫向彎曲軸的彎矩~Tendon offset from the section centroid creates bending about a transverse axis | 預力筋位置與幾何~tendon positions and geometry | 偏心正負號錯誤會顛倒有利或不利作用~Wrong eccentricity sign reverses beneficial and adverse action
彈性撓度檢核~Elastic deflection check | P[N]=60000; L[m]=1.6; E[Pa]=30000000000; I[m4]=0.0001 | P*L**3/(48*E*I)*1000 | mm | 簡支梁撓度對跨度呈三次方依賴~Simply supported beam deflection depends on span cubed | 載重位移與支點沉陷~load-displacement and support settlement | 支點下陷會被誤算成試件撓度~Support settlement can be mistaken for specimen deflection
軌座接觸壓力~Rail-seat contact pressure | F[kN]=90; A[m2]=0.06 | F/A | kPa | 接觸面積縮小會提高平均軌座壓力~Reduced contact area increases mean rail-seat pressure | 接觸印跡與壓力分布~contact imprint and pressure distribution | 不均支承會讓局部壓碎先發生~Uneven support can trigger local crushing first
裂縫開口變化~Crack-opening change | w1[mm]=0.08; w2[mm]=0.12 | w2-w1 | mm | 裂縫變化要在相同荷載和溫度下比較~Crack changes require matched load and temperature | 裂縫計與同步載重~crack gauge and synchronized load | 荷載不同會被誤判為永久裂縫成長~Different loads can resemble permanent crack growth
吸水質量比例~Water absorption fraction | wet[kg]=105; dry[kg]=100 | (wet-dry)/dry*100 | percent | 乾重基準吸水率反映試驗條件下的含水增加~Dry-basis absorption measures moisture gain under specified test conditions | 乾燥與浸水稱量~dry and immersed-condition weighing | 表面附水未處理會高估吸水~Unaccounted surface water overstates absorption
循環強度保留~Cyclic strength retention | after[kN]=90; before[kN]=100 | after/before*100 | percent | 殘餘強度比只適用所用循環歷程~Residual strength ratio applies to the tested cycling history | 循環數與破壞荷載~cycle count and failure load | 不同循環幅值不能只按次數比較~Different amplitudes cannot be compared by count alone
動態彈模比較~Dynamic modulus ratio | f1[Hz]=450; f0[Hz]=500 | (f1/f0)**2*100 | percent | 幾何質量相同時共振頻率平方比可作動態剛度指標~At unchanged geometry and mass, squared resonance-frequency ratio indicates dynamic stiffness | 共振頻率及試件質量~resonant frequency and specimen mass | 含水質量改變會干擾剛度判讀~Moisture mass change confounds stiffness inference''')

C(351,'geometry','道岔線形組裝公差與輪軌導引~Turnout alignment assembly tolerances and wheel guidance',
 '高速道岔不是單一轉向角，而是尖軌、導曲線與轍叉協同導引；各構件公差需回到共同中心線和輪對通過包絡~A high-speed turnout is not a single angle but coordinated guidance by switch rails, closure curves and crossing; component tolerances need one centreline and wheelset passage envelope',
 '道岔縮尺模型、幾何尺與合成位置資料~scaled turnout models, geometric gauges and synthetic position data',
 '剛性幾何與低載模型，不提供營運道岔調整門檻~rigid geometry and low-load models, not operating turnout adjustment thresholds',
 '''道岔分岔角估算~Turnout divergence angle | n[1]=18 | atan(1/n)*180/pi | degree | 分岔角與道岔號數的定義需一致~Divergence angle requires a consistent turnout-number definition | 中心線方向與號數定義~centreline directions and turnout-number definition | 混用不同號數定義會錯配構件~Mixed turnout-number conventions mismatch components
導曲線橫向加速~Closure-curve lateral acceleration | v[m/s]=45; R[m]=1800 | v**2/R | m/s2 | 分歧路徑速度與導曲線半徑共同決定幾何橫向需求~Diverging speed and closure radius jointly determine geometric lateral demand | 分歧速度與曲率~diverging speed and curvature | 直股速度不能直接當作側股速度~Through-route speed cannot simply become diverging-route speed
兩端座標閉合~Endpoint coordinate closure | dx[mm]=2; dy[mm]=3 | sqrt(dx**2+dy**2) | mm | 道岔端點閉合應保留方向與共同座標~Turnout endpoint closure needs direction and common coordinates | 獨立控制點測量~independent control-point survey | 整組偏移可被內部相對量測忽略~Internal relative measurements can miss whole-assembly displacement
支承高差坡度~Support-level slope | dz[mm]=2; L[m]=4 | dz/L | mm/m | 連續支承高程影響道岔平順而非只看單點高度~Support-level continuity governs smoothness beyond individual point heights | 各長岔枕高程~levels of successive bearers | 長枕局部懸空會在載重後改變線形~A locally unsupported bearer changes geometry under load
尖軌相對位移~Switch-rail relative movement | tip[mm]=120; base[mm]=5 | tip-base | mm | 尖端與根部位移差描述相對彎曲而非整體平移~Tip-minus-root movement describes relative bending rather than translation | 尖端與根部同步位移~synchronized tip and root displacement | 底座鬆動會使命令行程不等於有效尖軌行程~Loose support makes commanded travel differ from useful rail movement
組裝公差疊加~Assembly tolerance stack | e1[mm]=0.4; e2[mm]=0.5; e3[mm]=0.3 | abs(e1)+abs(e2)+abs(e3) | mm | 最壞同向公差以絕對值相加，與統計均方根不同~Worst-case aligned tolerances add magnitudes, unlike statistical root-sum-square | 構件尺寸與公差方向~component dimensions and tolerance directions | 把最壞值改用均方根會低估保證邊界~Using RMS for worst-case guarantees understates the bound
緊固件夾持分配~Fastener clamp-force allocation | F[kN]=80; n[count]=4 | F/n | kN | 均分假設需構件剛度及幾何對稱~Equal sharing requires symmetric stiffness and geometry | 各緊固點力或伸長~force or extension at each fastening point | 扭矩相同不保證預緊力相同~Equal torque does not guarantee equal preload
輪緣導引時間~Flange-guidance time | L[m]=12; v[m/s]=30 | L/v | s | 指定導引長度的通過時間隨速度反比變化~Passage time through a given guidance length decreases inversely with speed | 輪對位置與時間~wheelset position and time | 取樣不足可能漏掉短時接觸~Insufficient sampling misses short contact events
量測溫差補正~Survey temperature correction | alpha[1/K]=0.0000115; L[m]=30; dT[K]=10 | alpha*L*dT*1000 | mm | 長鋼構件的熱伸長可能與組裝公差同量級~Thermal length change of long steel components can match assembly tolerances | 構件溫度與基準長度~component temperature and reference length | 日照造成的溫差會混入組裝誤差~Sun-driven temperature difference appears as assembly error
檢驗覆蓋清單~Inspection checklist coverage | done[count]=45; required[count]=50 | done/required*100 | percent | 清單完成比例不等於系統安全通過率~Checklist completion is not a system safety pass rate | 每項驗證證據與未完成項~evidence for each check and open items | 用完成率取代關鍵項未通過會造成假結案~Completion percentage can hide a failed critical item''')

C(352,'signal','可動心軌位置鎖閉與回讀一致性~Movable frog position locking and feedback consistency',
 '可動心軌在不同路徑下提供連續輪面支承，位置、機械鎖閉與電氣表示是三種獨立證據；命令發出並不等於路徑已可使用~A movable frog provides continuous running support for different routes; position, mechanical locking and electrical indication are separate evidence, and issuing a command does not establish route availability',
 '隔離低壓縮尺模型、位置開關與事件記錄~isolated low-voltage scale models, position switches and event records',
 '教學狀態機與幾何模型，不是可部署安全控制器~teaching state machines and geometry, not a deployable safety controller',
 '''心軌平均行程速度~Mean frog travel speed | travel[mm]=80; time[s]=4 | travel/time | mm/s | 平均速度不描述起動和鎖閉區的局部速度~Mean speed does not describe local speed during starting and locking | 全行程位置時間曲線~full-stroke position-time trace | 相同平均速度可隱藏末端卡阻~Equal mean speeds can hide end-position binding
鎖閉時間餘量~Locking time reserve | timeout[s]=8; move[s]=4; prove[s]=1 | timeout-move-prove | s | 移動和證明時間共同消耗超時預算~Movement and proving time consume one timeout budget | 命令位置鎖閉的時間戳~command, position and lock timestamps | 只監測馬達停止會漏掉未鎖閉狀態~Monitoring motor stop alone misses an unlocked state
感測器分辨率~Position sensor resolution | stroke[mm]=100; counts[count]=4096 | stroke/counts | mm/count | 數位分辨率不是絕對位置精度~Digital resolution is not absolute position accuracy | 基準尺與編碼器對照~reference gauge versus encoder reading | 高位元數可能掩蓋機械間隙~High bit depth can conceal mechanical backlash
推力量級估算~Actuation-force scale | P[W]=100; eta[1]=0.5; v[m/s]=0.02 | P*eta/v | N | 固定機械速度下可用推力受功率及效率限制~Available force at fixed speed depends on power and efficiency | 低載模型推力及速度~low-load model force and speed | 以堵轉電流直接推定有效推力可能失準~Stall current alone can misrepresent useful force
行程不一致量~Stroke discrepancy | commanded[mm]=80; measured[mm]=75 | commanded-measured | mm | 命令與實測差描述運動鏈的未完成量~Command-minus-measured travel describes an incomplete movement chain | 獨立位移與控制器紀錄~independent displacement and controller log | 連桿鬆脫使馬達到位但心軌未到位~A detached linkage lets the motor arrive without the frog
雙感測差異量~Dual-sensor disagreement | s1[mm]=79.8; s2[mm]=78.9 | abs(s1-s2) | mm | 雙感測不一致應保留診斷狀態而非直接平均~Disagreement should preserve a diagnostic state rather than be averaged away | 兩條獨立量測鏈~two independent measurement chains | 同源感測器可能共同錯誤而仍一致~Common-source sensors can agree while both are wrong
狀態覆蓋數量~State-space combination count | bits[count]=4 | 2**bits | states | 二元狀態組合數快速增加，需先定義不可接受組合~Binary combinations grow rapidly and require explicitly forbidden states | 狀態表與自動重播~state tables and automated replay | 只測正常切換會漏掉矛盾表示~Testing only normal transitions misses contradictory indication
資料陳舊位移~Stale-data movement scale | v[mm/s]=20; stale[s]=0.3 | v*stale | mm | 延遲位置資訊可能落後真實位置一段距離~Delayed position data can lag the true position by a finite distance | 時間戳與現值比對~timestamp and current-position comparison | 舊到位表示不可當作當前鎖閉證據~An old arrival indication is not current lock evidence
獨立漏檢乘積~Independent miss coincidence | p1[1]=0.01; p2[1]=0.02 | p1*p2 | 1 | 只有獨立漏檢才可用乘積，不能套用共同原因故障~Only independent misses multiply; common-cause faults violate this assumption | 人工注入故障與獨立性證據~injected faults and evidence of independence | 共享電源故障會讓乘積估計過度樂觀~Shared supply failure makes the product estimate optimistic
回讀掃描間距~Feedback scan interval | fs[Hz]=50 | 1/fs*1000 | ms | 掃描週期是延遲的一部分而非全部~Scan period is only one part of latency | 輸入輸出共同時鐘紀錄~input-output records on one clock | 忽略通訊與排程延遲會低估反應時間~Ignoring communication and scheduling understates response time''')

C(353,'thermal','道岔加熱熱損融冰與控制遲滯~Turnout heating heat loss ice melting and control hysteresis',
 '道岔加熱需把熱量送到真正阻礙動作的位置，環境風、冰水相變與機械遮蔽會改變效果；耗電增加不能直接證明融雪能力改善~Turnout heating must deliver heat to locations that actually obstruct movement; wind, ice-water phase change and mechanical shielding alter effectiveness, so more electricity does not by itself prove better snow melting',
 '低壓加熱模型、溫度感測器與熱量帳~low-voltage heating models, temperature sensors and heat accounts',
 '集中熱容量或一維穩態教學模型~lumped heat capacity or one-dimensional steady teaching models',
 '''加熱電功率~Heater electrical power | V[V]=24; R[ohm]=12 | V**2/R | W | 固定電壓下電阻升高會降低純電阻加熱功率~At fixed voltage, increased resistance lowers resistive heating power | 隔離低壓電壓電流量測~isolated low-voltage current and voltage readings | 接點電阻會把熱量耗在不需要的位置~Contact resistance dissipates heat at unwanted locations
冰融化潛熱~Ice melting latent heat | m[kg]=0.2; latent[kJ/kg]=334 | m*latent | kJ | 融冰必須供應潛熱，即使溫度停留在相變附近~Melting requires latent heat even when temperature remains near the phase change | 冰質量與融水量~ice mass and meltwater mass | 只計溫升會低估融冰所需熱量~Counting only temperature rise understates melting energy
理想融冰時間~Ideal melting duration | E[kJ]=66.8; P[W]=40 | E*1000/P | s | 能量除有效功率是理想時間，下限取決於損失是否忽略~Energy divided by useful power gives an ideal time, with ignored losses making it a lower estimate | 有效熱輸入與融冰完成時刻~useful heat input and melting completion time | 風冷與排水帶熱會延長實際時間~Wind cooling and warm drainage extend real duration
對流熱損量~Convective heat loss | h[W/m2K]=15; A[m2]=0.2; dT[K]=20 | h*A*dT | W | 對流熱損取決於暴露面積與環境條件~Convection loss depends on exposed area and environmental conditions | 表面氣溫與風況~surface-air temperature and wind conditions | 風速增加會使原有效功率不足~Increased wind can make previously adequate power insufficient
鋼件顯熱負荷~Steel sensible-heat demand | m[kg]=3; c[J/kgK]=500; dT[K]=10 | m*c*dT/1000 | kJ | 先加熱鋼件所需熱量與融冰潛熱分屬不同帳~Heating steel and melting ice are separate energy accounts | 鋼件質量與平均溫升~steel mass and mean temperature rise | 巨大熱容量會造成啟動延遲~Large heat capacity creates start-up delay
加熱效率比例~Useful heating fraction | useful[W]=30; input[W]=48 | useful/input*100 | percent | 有效熱量比例須定義送到哪個作用區~Useful fraction needs a defined target region | 作用區熱量與輸入電能~target-zone heat and electrical input
控制遲滯帶寬~Control hysteresis width | off[degC]=5; on[degC]=2 | off-on | K | 開關門檻差可以降低頻繁切換，但也改變溫度波動~Threshold separation reduces rapid switching but changes temperature fluctuation | 開關事件與溫度時間序列~switching events and temperature trace | 無遲滯且有雜訊時可能快速抖動~Noise without hysteresis can cause rapid chatter
溫度時間常數~Thermal time constant | C[J/K]=1500; H[W/K]=5 | C/H | s | 集中模型的時間常數為熱容量除總散熱導納~A lumped thermal time constant is heat capacity divided by heat-loss conductance | 階躍加熱的溫度反應~temperature response to a heating step | 用穩態溫度推論升溫速度會失準~Steady temperature does not determine heating speed
降雪水當量負荷~Snow water-equivalent load | area[m2]=0.5; depth[m]=0.02; rho[kg/m3]=100 | area*depth*rho | kg | 雪密度改變會讓同厚度有不同融化負荷~Snow density changes melting load even at equal depth | 雪深面積與密度樣本~snow depth, area and density samples | 只按雪深判斷負荷會忽略濕雪~Depth-only estimates overlook wet-snow mass
感測器偏差餘量~Sensor-bias reserve | target[degC]=3; bias[K]=1.2 | target-bias | degC | 正偏差會讓控制器以為比實際更溫暖~Positive bias makes the controller believe conditions are warmer than reality | 獨立參考溫度與控制讀值~independent reference temperature and control reading | 感測器貼附不良會增加環境偏差~Poor sensor attachment increases ambient bias'''.replace('作用區熱量與輸入電能~target-zone heat and electrical input\n','作用區熱量與輸入電能~target-zone heat and electrical input | 加熱位置錯誤會使高耗電仍無法解除卡冰~Wrong heater placement can consume power without releasing trapped ice\n'))
